# tiny-notes

A deliberately tiny zero-dependency note store used as a sandbox for SAGE-Kit + DSH.

```bash
node src/cli.js add "buy milk"
node src/cli.js list
node src/cli.js remove <id>
node --test
```

Known seeded bug: `removeNote` currently drops the note after the requested one.
